1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,033
A vending machine, smashed open by
someone long ago. Eleven bottles left.
Sealed. Dusty. Beautiful.

2
00:00:06,533 --> 00:00:12,333
In the middle of the mall, a fountain.
Clear water. A koi pond right next to
it, fat orange fish, alive.

3
00:00:12,833 --> 00:00:19,267
A fountain recycles the same water for
a year. Birds. Dust. Coins. And things
you can't see. Would you drink it?

4
00:00:19,767 --> 00:00:23,733
Rule four. Only drink what's sealed,
or what you've boiled for a full
minute.
